### Health Check Tests ###

### Basic health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

### Full health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?full=true

### Check database component
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?component=database

### Check redis component
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?component=redis

### Check server component
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?component=server

### Check memory component
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?component=memory

### Check disk component
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?component=disk

### Check external API component
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?component=externalApi

### Check message queue component
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?component=messageQueue

### Check with custom timeout
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health?timeout=10000

### Error Testing ###

### 1. Validation Error (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=VALIDATION

### 2. Authentication Error (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=AUTHENTICATION

### 3. Authorization Error (403)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=AUTHORIZATION

### 4. Not Found Error (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=NOT_FOUND

### 5. Bad Request Error (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=BAD_REQUEST

### 6. Internal Error (500)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=INTERNAL

### 7. Service Error (500)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=SERVICE

### 8. Unknown Error (500)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health/test-error?type=UNKNOWN

### Expected Responses ###

